that I love to collect?

00:18:48.085 --> 00:18:49.086
- Ooh.

00:18:49.086 --> 00:18:50.963
- This is, like,
three separate things.

00:18:50.963 --> 00:18:53.132
So if you get even one of
them, I'd be surprised.

00:18:53.132 --> 00:18:57.386
- Don't you have a Navajo
rug in your house?

00:18:57.386 --> 00:18:57.886
- Oh, yeah.

00:18:57.886 --> 00:18:59.138
That's actually—
