be trading cards.
[Ding]

00:19:02.891 --> 00:19:08.021
- And No. 3 would be—

00:19:08.021 --> 00:19:09.189
- Vintage patches.

00:19:09.189 --> 00:19:10.274
- Vintage patches.

00:19:10.274 --> 00:19:11.358
I know you like patches.

00:19:11.358 --> 00:19:12.901
I didn't know that
they were vintage.

00:19:12.901 --> 00:19:15.362
- No, but the rugs and stuff,
