00:19:52.149 --> 00:19:54.276
You even went with
the AVA, but yes.

00:19:54.276 --> 00:19:55.944
L'Angolo Estate, Dundee Hills.

00:19:55.944 --> 00:19:58.363
Go ahead.

00:19:58.363 --> 00:19:59.823
